WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:07.360
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I’m going to&nbsp;
explain the first part of a drama mini series&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:16.240
called “Click Bait,” Spoilers&nbsp;
ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:20.000
The beginning of the episode shows&nbsp;
us Andrea Brewer’s birthday party.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.520
Her family has gathered to celebrate the&nbsp;
occasion. Her son Nick, daughter, Pia,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:31.520
along with her Nick’s wife Sophie get Andrea&nbsp;
a birthday present. Pia is disappointed to see&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:36.080
that the present is a planter when she had&nbsp;
asked Sophie to get a bread maker instead.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:46.880
She makes snarky comments to Sophie about&nbsp;
her ideas being lame. Nick gets mad at her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:53.040
for disrespecting his wife and asks her to leave&nbsp;
the party immediately. Nick and Sophie’s sons,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.040 --> 00:00:58.800
Ethan and Kai look at the adults fighting in&nbsp;
horror. Pia embarrassingly leaves and goes to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:58.800 --> 00:01:04.480
a club. She drinks a lot and dances wildy to&nbsp;
forget what happened earlier. Sometime later,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:10.160
she is in the club’s bathroom, texting a man named&nbsp;
Woody, who she matched on a dating app. She texts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.160 --> 00:01:14.960
him to meet her but accidentally drops her phone&nbsp;
in the toilet when she gets up to flush. 
&nbsp;

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:19.840
In the following scene, she is in her apartment,&nbsp;
putting her phone in rice so it would soak all the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:25.200
water and repair itself. The next day, she drives&nbsp;
to the hospital where she works as a nurse. She is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:30.640
assisting a patient as he shows her interesting&nbsp;
videos online to keep himself distracted. In one&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:30.640 --> 00:01:36.400
of the videos, Pia’s brother Nick is holding&nbsp;
up a card that says "I abuse women." He then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:43.200
holds up a different card that says "At 5 million&nbsp;
views I die." He seems to be beaten and scared,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:48.880
as if someone is making him hold the signs. Pia&nbsp;
is shocked and doesn’t know what’s going on.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:53.920
She rushes to the hospital’s phone to call Nick&nbsp;
but the call goes straight to voicemail. She then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:59.760
calls Nick’s wife’s Sophie but she doesn’t pick up&nbsp;
either. Pia freaks out and rushes to Nick’s work.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:05.040
She then asks his coworker Matt about him. Matt&nbsp;
claims that he hasn’t seen him since the morning.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:05.040 --> 00:02:10.960
Pia shows him the video which worries Matt, so&nbsp;
he asks his other coworker Dawn if she saw Nick.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:15.200
The two find out that he missed his eight&nbsp;
oclock meeting and hasn’t been to work yet.
&nbsp;

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:19.920
Pia is now more worried than ever, so she&nbsp;
rushes to the school where Sophie teaches.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:25.440
She barges inside even when the guards warn her&nbsp;
not to. Sophie gets rid of the guard and watches&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:30.960
the video herself. She is as shocked as Pia to&nbsp;
watch it. According to her, Nick left for work&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:36.160
as usual in the morning, so the video makes&nbsp;
no sense. The two then go to the police to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:36.160 --> 00:02:41.920
file a missing report. On their way, the views in&nbsp;
Nick’s video reaches nine thousand and proceeds to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:48.080
increase rapidly. The case is handled by a police&nbsp;
detective named Roshan Armiri. The detective asks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:53.760
them several questions about Nick and focuses on&nbsp;
the part about him assaulting women. Sophie calmly&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:53.760 --> 00:02:59.120
answers all his questions but Pia gets annoyed.&nbsp;
She and Roshan seem to know each other but do not&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:59.120 --> 00:03:05.200
act on the fact. Sophie gets a call from her older&nbsp;
son Ethan and goes back home to them. The boys are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:10.320
distressed to see the video of their father. Ethan&nbsp;
is on his tablet trying to access the “Find my&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:10.320 --> 00:03:16.320
fam” app which might show where Nick is. However,&nbsp;
the app cannot find his location because his phone&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:16.320 --> 00:03:22.080
is turned off. The video has reached three hundred&nbsp;
thousand views in just some hours and everyone in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:26.800
the comments is calling Nick a monster. Sophie&nbsp;
tells the kids to not watch the video anymore&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:31.360
and stop going to school for the time being. 
Pia returns back to her apartment to see that her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:36.480
phone is finally working. She finds a voicemail&nbsp;
from Nick in which he apologizes for their fight&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:40.960
the previous day and says there are things he&nbsp;
needs to talk about with her. Pia plays the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:46.560
voicemail on repeat while driving to her mother&nbsp;
Andrea’s house. She asks Andrea if she has talked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:52.560
to Nick that day but Andrea says she hasn’t. Pia&nbsp;
opts to not tell her about the situation so she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:52.560 --> 00:03:57.520
wouldn't worry. Just then, she gets a text from&nbsp;
Sophie asking her to come to the police station&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:57.520 --> 00:04:03.280
immediately. There, the two find out that another&nbsp;
video of Nick has been uploaded to the website.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:03.280 --> 00:04:08.640
In this one, he holds a card that says “I killed&nbsp;
a woman.” Since, the case has turned to homicide,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:14.720
detective Roshan’s competitive colleague, Det.&nbsp;
Zach De Luca is added to investigate the case. 
&nbsp;

00:04:14.720 --> 00:04:19.760
After watching the video, Pia immediately&nbsp;
recognizes that the first two signs were in Nick's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:19.760 --> 00:04:25.280
handwriting, the third one is not. Luca believes&nbsp;
that the video might be a confession and asks the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:30.640
women if Nick is known to be violent. An enraged&nbsp;
Sophie tells him that Nick wouldn't hurt anyone,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:30.640 --> 00:04:36.400
man or woman. Pia also retaliates saying Nick is&nbsp;
the victim and the detectives should do something&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:41.600
before the video reaches five million views. When&nbsp;
Sophie and Pia come out of the police station,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:41.600 --> 00:04:46.880
Pia shows Sophie the voicemail she received and&nbsp;
asks her if she should show it to the police. But&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:51.840
Sophie wants to keep the mail on the low because&nbsp;
Nick sounds apologetic in it, which wouldn't help&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:51.840 --> 00:04:56.800
their case as the police already suspect him to&nbsp;
be a murderer. As they talk, Sophie gets a call&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:56.800 --> 00:05:01.760
from a journalist who wants to interview her.&nbsp;
The two get more nervous because of the call.
&nbsp;

00:05:01.760 --> 00:05:07.840
The video now has over a million and a half views.&nbsp;
A nervous Pia goes to her computer genius friend&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:12.720
Vince and asks him to somehow find Nick’s&nbsp;
location. Vince says that finding out Nick’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:18.000
location is beyond his reach but he has created&nbsp;
a subport where people from around the world&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:18.000 --> 00:05:22.480
are investigating Nick’s case and helping to&nbsp;
look for him. Pia doesn’t believe that a mere&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:22.480 --> 00:05:27.600
website can find her brother but appreciates the&nbsp;
help anyway. After that she makes way to Nick’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:27.600 --> 00:05:33.280
house and is approached by a reporter outside. Pia&nbsp;
yells at her to stay out of the private property&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:33.280 --> 00:05:38.720
and goes inside. A disappointed Andrea confronts&nbsp;
her for keeping Nick’s disappearance from her.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:38.720 --> 00:05:42.880
She apologises and checks up on&nbsp;
Nick’s son Ethan, who seems to be calm&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:42.880 --> 00:05:48.320
and playing games at the time of crisis. 
When Pia goes back to her apartment, the video has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:48.320 --> 00:05:54.000
made the news because of its popularity. Suddenly,&nbsp;
her hacker friend Vince arrives with important&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:59.120
information. The people in the subport have found&nbsp;
out that the video was taken in a specific kind&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:04.480
of delivery van by analysing the symbols in the&nbsp;
background. Pia thanks Vince and takes the proof&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:09.360
to the police. They begin to look for the specific&nbsp;
van through the traffic cameras while Pia waits&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:09.360 --> 00:06:14.560
outside, accompanied by Nick’s coworker Matt.&nbsp;
After a while, she refreshes the website and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:20.000
sees that the views have reached five million.&nbsp;
Just then, Roshan and the officers come outside&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:24.560
claiming that they have found the van. 
Everyone quickly rushes to the location with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.560 --> 00:06:30.720
a SWAT team, only to find that the van is empty.&nbsp;
They search around the area but find nothing. At&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:35.920
last, the police conclude that Nick was not in the&nbsp;
van when it was disposed of. Back at the police&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:35.920 --> 00:06:41.600
station, Luca assigns tasks to all the officers&nbsp;
involved in the case but excludes Roshan because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:41.600 --> 00:06:46.720
he is not from the homicide department, and his&nbsp;
services are no longer needed. When Roshan tries&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:52.720
to retaliate, Luca asks him to accompany Sophie&nbsp;
to her home. Outside her house, Sophie is mobbed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:58.960
by the reporters. Roshan escorts her inside to see&nbsp;
that the house is being investigated for evidence.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:03.520
Several police officers spread around looking&nbsp;
for anything significant clue that they can find.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:08.640
The kids ask Sophie if Nick has been found&nbsp;
and she assures them he will be back soon.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:08.640 --> 00:07:13.040
Just then Luca arrives at the house and&nbsp;
seizes all the family members’ phones&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:13.040 --> 00:07:16.960
so they can extract data that can&nbsp;
potentially help them with the case. 
&nbsp;

00:07:16.960 --> 00:07:21.600
The family is skeptical about the procedure,&nbsp;
saying that they are being treated as suspects.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:21.600 --> 00:07:26.480
Everyone hands their phone except for Pia who&nbsp;
says that hers is at her apartment because it is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:26.480 --> 00:07:32.800
broken. Amidst the search, Pia goes out to smoke.&nbsp;
Roshan follows her behind for a chat. As the two&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:32.800 --> 00:07:37.360
talk we find out that they have been chatting with&nbsp;
each other through a dating app for a long time.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:37.360 --> 00:07:42.800
In fact, before Pia’s phone dropped in the toilet,&nbsp;
she was planning to meet Roshan. She asks him to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:47.760
keep her on the loop with anything that happens&nbsp;
with the case. However, Roshan reveals he has been&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:47.760 --> 00:07:52.800
removed from it because he is from the missing&nbsp;
person department. He suggests Pia request the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:52.800 --> 00:07:58.240
sergant to put him on the case and Pia agrees. 
Later, Roshan is searching the house on his own&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:58.240 --> 00:08:03.360
when he sees Ethan in his room with a tablet.&nbsp;
Etahn says that it was his father’s old tablet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:03.360 --> 00:08:08.640
that no one uses anymore. Roshan still asks&nbsp;
for it to see if it has something important&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:08.640 --> 00:08:13.360
but Etahn insists he needs it to monitor the&nbsp;
search. He explains that Nick’s case has grown&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:13.360 --> 00:08:18.800
so popular that people have established an app&nbsp;
called “gionicking” dedicated to his search.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:18.800 --> 00:08:23.440
In the app, people go around areas in the city&nbsp;
where Nick can potentially be found and search&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:29.200
for him. The areas that have already been searched&nbsp;
are marked off the map in red. This peaks Roshan’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:34.000
interest and he takes the tablet for himself. 
He then goes to the police station and shows&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:39.200
the app to the sergeant. But, she is not in the&nbsp;
favour of involving the civilians in the search.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:43.520
Roshan also shows her the text messages that&nbsp;
were extracted from Ethan’s phone where he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:43.520 --> 00:08:48.480
talks about a big fight between his parents. When&nbsp;
Roshan walks outside of the sergeant’s office,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:48.480 --> 00:08:54.000
detective Luca condescendingly asks him to go&nbsp;
home. Roshan then makes his way to a sight that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:54.000 --> 00:08:58.880
hasn’t been searched through geonicking and&nbsp;
finds two teenagers searching for Nick’s body.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:58.880 --> 00:09:04.240
With no progress, Roshan visits the mosque and&nbsp;
then his home. His parents had seen him in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:04.240 --> 00:09:09.120
news earlier and are proud of him for working in&nbsp;
such a big case. They ask him when he is going to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:13.120
be promoted to the homicide department&nbsp;
but Roshan dismisses the question. 
&nbsp;

00:09:13.120 --> 00:09:16.480
The following day, Sophie makes an&nbsp;
official statement to the reporters,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:16.480 --> 00:09:22.320
asking Nick’s kidnapers not to hurt him. Later,&nbsp;
Pia asks Roshan to meet her alone in his car&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:22.320 --> 00:09:27.280
and shows him the voice message Nick had left her&nbsp;
before his disappearance. Roshan is annoyed at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:27.280 --> 00:09:31.680
her for not providing them with the information&nbsp;
sooner but Pia defends herself by saying they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:31.680 --> 00:09:36.480
can go through her phone now. He asks her what&nbsp;
“problem” Roshan wanted to talk to her about,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:36.480 --> 00:09:40.640
but Pia doesn’t know it either. Roshan then&nbsp;
goes to the sergeant and tells her about the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:46.400
newfound information. He also comes clean of his&nbsp;
relationship with Pia before Nick’s disappearance.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:46.400 --> 00:09:51.120
After that, he returns back to his desk, only&nbsp;
to find the pictures from his dating profile&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:51.120 --> 00:09:56.320
pasted all over his station. Luca laughs&nbsp;
at him for it. An enraged Roshan blames&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:56.320 --> 00:10:00.640
him for being discriminatory towards him&nbsp;
because of his religion. But Luca claps&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:00.640 --> 00:10:05.440
back saying that Roshan is not a team player&nbsp;
and is using this case to get promoted.
&nbsp;

00:10:05.440 --> 00:10:10.720
The next day, Nick’s bike is found by the side&nbsp;
of a secluded road. The police rush there and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:10.720 --> 00:10:16.560
investigate the scene. Soon, an empty syringe is&nbsp;
found nearby. They conclude that it was used to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:16.560 --> 00:10:23.040
kidnap Nick. After the investigation, Nick goes to&nbsp;
Sophie’s home and is received by her mother Ruby.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:23.040 --> 00:10:27.520
He informs the family about Nick’s bike&nbsp;
being found and asks to speak to Sophie&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:32.880
in private. He asks her about Nick’s voicemail&nbsp;
to Pia to which she reveals about their fight the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:38.800
night prior. Then, Roshan inquires if Sophie and&nbsp;
Nick were facing some marital issues before his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:44.000
disappearance. Sophie, unsettled by the question,&nbsp;
claims that the status of their relationship has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:49.280
nothing to do with Nick’s disappearance. Roshan&nbsp;
gets suspicious and directly asks her if she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:49.280 --> 00:10:55.200
knows where her husband is. Sophie looks at him in&nbsp;
disbelief and asks him to get out of the house.
&nbsp;

00:10:55.760 --> 00:11:00.640
Next, he goes to Pia’s apartment to find her&nbsp;
observing the geonicking app. He asks her about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:00.640 --> 00:11:05.280
her fight with Nick only to be dismissed.&nbsp;
Eventually she tells them she and Nick are&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:05.280 --> 00:11:10.800
closer than most siblings but he had been acting&nbsp;
differently for a few months. They got in a fight&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:10.800 --> 00:11:16.160
because she called him out on it. She also reveals&nbsp;
that on March 16th, he came to her with bruises&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:16.160 --> 00:11:21.200
and told her to keep it a secret from Sophie.&nbsp;
As they talk, the geonicking app shows Nick’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:21.200 --> 00:11:26.720
body has been found. Roshan and Pia quickly&nbsp;
rush to the location where a crowd of people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:26.720 --> 00:11:32.640
surround Nick’s body. However, getting closer to&nbsp;
it, they see that the “body” is just a mannequin&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:32.640 --> 00:11:38.160
with Nick's face pasted on it as a joke. 
After the incident, Roshan drops Pia off at her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:38.160 --> 00:11:44.160
apartment where Nick’s co-worker Matt is waiting&nbsp;
for her outside. She and Matt go inside as Roshan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:44.160 --> 00:11:50.880
drives away. At night, the detective uses the find&nbsp;
my fam app to look where Nick was on 16th March.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:50.880 --> 00:11:55.440
He finds out he was at a bar and visits the&nbsp;
owner the following day. While watching the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:55.440 --> 00:12:01.360
CCTV footage, he sees that Nick had gotten into&nbsp;
a fight with an unknown man that day. Later,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:01.360 --> 00:12:06.640
he calls Pia to the police station and shows&nbsp;
her the video of the fight. Pia sighs of relief&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:06.640 --> 00:12:12.160
that they finally have a lead and thanks Roshan&nbsp;
for working hard on the case. After Pia leaves,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:12.160 --> 00:12:17.440
Roshan presents his idea about the geonicking&nbsp;
to Luca who dismisses him at first but agrees&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:17.440 --> 00:12:22.720
to go on a search anyway. They reach the woods&nbsp;
by an abandoned road where Roshan finally finds&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:28.560
Nick’s decaying dead body in a nearby river. 
In the following scene, we see Roshan walk up to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:33.840
Pia in her apartment and inform her of the&nbsp;
dead body being found. Even though Pia had&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:33.840 --> 00:12:37.840
anticipated this, she breaks down crying&nbsp;
on the floor mourning her brother’s death.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:43.520
The next day, Roshan is welcomed into the police&nbsp;
station with applause. The sergeant promotes him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:43.520 --> 00:12:48.640
to the homicide department and even Luca praises&nbsp;
him for his goodwork. He then helps his coworker&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:48.640 --> 00:12:54.160
to go through Sophie’s socials. While working,&nbsp;
Roshan notices a picture of Sophie with a man&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:54.160 --> 00:12:59.200
who looks like the guy Nick got into a fight&nbsp;
with at the bar. A surprised Roshan rechecks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:59.200 --> 00:13:04.160
and confirms that it is the same man. 
In the following scene, we see Sophie at the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:04.160 --> 00:13:09.920
police station. Roshan officially informs her of&nbsp;
her husband’s death. She freezes on hearing the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:09.920 --> 00:13:16.240
news and asks the detective how he died. Luca&nbsp;
reveals that he had head trauma but the reason&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:16.240 --> 00:13:22.240
hasn’t been confirmed yet. She sheds a single tear&nbsp;
and asks them who was responsible. Luca then shows&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:22.240 --> 00:13:27.920
her the footage of Nick’s fight with the man and&nbsp;
asks Sophie if she knows him. To their surprise,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:27.920 --> 00:13:34.240
she lies and says she doesn’t. Then, she is&nbsp;
shown a picture of them together. Sophie finally&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:34.240 --> 00:13:39.760
admits that the man is her former colleague named&nbsp;
Curtis Hamilton. She claims they are just friends&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:39.760 --> 00:13:44.480
and coworkers but after her first lie,&nbsp;
the detectives find it hard to believe.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:44.480 --> 00:13:50.000
Later, she returns home and sits all of her&nbsp;
family down. She finally reveals to the kids&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:13:50.000 --> 00:13:55.680
that their father is not returning home. All of&nbsp;
them burst into tears, grieving Nick’s death. 
&nbsp;

00:13:56.240 --> 00:14:01.360
Then, we see Pia at the police station demanding&nbsp;
Roshan to let her see her brother’s body.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:01.360 --> 00:14:06.720
However, she is not allowed to see him until the&nbsp;
postmortem. Back in the house, Sophie tells her&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:11.200
mother that she was inquired about Curtis by&nbsp;
the police. When she reveals that she referred&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:11.200 --> 00:14:16.240
to him as just a friend, her mother looks at her&nbsp;
in disbelief. It is clear that something was going&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:16.240 --> 00:14:20.720
on in between the two. Sophie cries saying&nbsp;
that if Curtis is the one who killed Nick,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:20.720 --> 00:14:26.560
it will be her fault. As they talk, Pia arrives at&nbsp;
the house asking if she can sleep for the night.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:26.560 --> 00:14:32.240
Sophie invites her but doesn’t tell her anything&nbsp;
about Curtis. Then, we are shown the flashback of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:32.240 --> 00:14:37.040
Nick and Sophie’s last wedding anniversary. They&nbsp;
had a party that they enjoyed to the fullest.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:37.040 --> 00:14:42.000
